~ start
Skester: [wave]Heheheehe![/wave]
The Jester in front of you giggles as he dances in front of you, jumping from one leg to another.
Skester: You are quite resourceful! I'm glad you made it all this way!

- I have freed the residents of this dungeon from your evil grasp!
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Skester: I'm not evil! I'm just funny! [wave]Heheheehe![/wave] 
	Skester: But have you ever seen a jester fight? [wave]Heheheehe![/wave]
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
    => END
- It's not funny. I'll be taking my leave now.
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Skester: [wave]Heheheehe![/wave]
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ BackForMore
Skester: There you are again! Let's play! [wave]Heheheehe![/wave]
- Bring it on!
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
	 => END
- What? No! I have better things to do.
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
	Skester: Awww... [wave]Heheheehe![/wave]
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ PostBattle
Suddenly Skester disappears in a big puff og smoke. You are left with the sense it's not the last you'll see of him.
Where the Jester once stood a portal has appeared. Maybe this is the exit?
do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
=> END